# Alliance zones per level band for auto_chain.py --bands (the shared chain, from level 19 on).
# A commonly used Alliance leveling path: only which zones to visit at which level is taken from it, as the user
# listed it in-game (2026-11-17). The quests, their order and the routes are still planned by plan_zone.py.
# Format: <from level> <to level> <zone> [<zone> ...]   (zone names as in auto_chain.SHORT)
